OM ØST AS is a private limited company registered in Elverum, founded 2015-10-23. EIENDOM ØST AS buys and sells cabin plots (hyttetomter) and rents out cabin plots. Its statutory purpose also covers buying and selling real estate, renting out real estate, related products and services, participating in similar companies, and buying and selling shares or otherwise taking interests in other enterprises. Its main industry code is 68.200: rental and operating of own or leased real estate. In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 18 780 NOK and the annual result was -3 473 NOK; operating income was up from 17 400 NOK in 2024. The annual result fell from 8 534 NOK in 2024 to -3 473 NOK in 2025. Equity fell from 130 508 NOK in 2024 to 127 035 NOK in 2025.","sentences":[{"text":"EIENDOM ØST AS is a private limited company registered in Elverum, founded 2015-10-23.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c7"]},{"text":"EIENDOM ØST AS buys and sells cabin plots (hyttetomter) and rents out cabin plots. Its statutory purpose also covers buying and selling real estate, renting out real estate, related products and services, participating in similar companies, and buying and selling shares or otherwise taking interests in other enterprises.","claim_ids":["c11","c10"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 68.200: rental and operating of own or leased real estate.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 18 780 NOK and the annual result was -3 473 NOK; operating income was up from 17 400 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c44","c47","c35"]},{"text":"The annual result fell from 8 534 NOK in 2024 to -3 473 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c38","c47"]},{"text":"Equity fell from 130 508 NOK in 2024 to 127 035 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c41","c50"]}],"unknowns":["Employee count: The register shows no registered employee count for this entity.","Registered workplaces: No registered sub-units (workplaces).","Open positions (NAV): No active NAV job ad names this orga